::  ++cury partial application of a wet gate whose sample mixes a gate-typed
::  element ($-) with faced cells — the zose hmac-sha256l shape (hmc) that
::  drives ++redo + ++mull through the wet closure produced by cury.
|%
++  wham
  |*  [[haj=$-([@u @] @) boq=@u] key=[wid=@ dat=@] msg=[wid=@ dat=@]]
  (haj boq (add wid.msg dat.key))
++  whaml  (cury wham [add 64])
++  main
  |=  x=@ud
  =/  oct  [p=4 q=x]
  !>((whaml [2 x] oct))
--
